# Backend & workers

- FastAPI app factory in `backend/app/main.py`; routes under `app/api/v1/`.
- Load config via `app.core.config.Settings` / `get_settings()` — do not read `os.environ` ad hoc.
- Keep endpoints thin; introduce services/repositories only when domain logic exists.
- `workers/` is Redis job scaffolding only until queues are explicitly implemented.
- Pin dependencies in `requirements.txt`. Match Python 3.12+ for local and CI.
